This repository contains original research code, experimental reports and
AI-assisted implementation/documentation. It is an independent research project,
not an official Mamba implementation or a peer-reviewed publication.

third_party/mamba contains unmodified Python reference files from
state-spaces/mamba, tag v2.2.5, by Albert Gu, Tri Dao and contributors.
Their original copyright notices and Apache-2.0 license are retained.
The functional PyTorch adapter in wsr/pretrained_model.py follows those
published equations; wsr/official_reference.py independently executes selected
official Python definitions for validation.

No pretrained model weights or WikiText/PG-19 document bodies are distributed.
External weights and datasets remain subject to their respective source terms.
